# Generated output files from slack_output_analysis.
# These need **/ rather than */: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to this
# file's directory and * does not cross separators, so */name.json only matches
# one level down and misses these files where they are actually written.
**/all_errors.json
**/cluster_state.json
**/error_report.json
**/incremental_error_report.json
**/build_slack_export_with_threads.json
**/commit_hash_cache.json
**/job_name_cache.json
temp.json

# Test artifacts - nested auto_triage directories created during tests
.github/actions/auto-triage/auto_triage/data/data
.github/actions/auto-triage/auto_triage/logs
.github/actions/auto-triage/auto_triage/output
